{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1509556142637162745,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Episode X: Adding load and store instructions",
      "source_hash": 16912411860298335538,
      "context_hash": 14395835298253861086,
      "translation": "X편: load와 store 명령어 추가하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "We are nearly there !",
      "source_hash": 6470434658361404138,
      "context_hash": 11222733156315225985,
      "translation": "거의 다 왔습니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "However, adding `load` and `store` requires some drastic additions to the design.",
      "source_hash": 12658622246727499491,
      "context_hash": 17020502971949229195,
      "translation": "하지만 `load`와 `store`를 추가하려면 설계에 상당히 큰 추가 작업이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Let us start from what's easy, the instruction decoder.",
      "source_hash": 2162380604178036147,
      "context_hash": 12506149426897741788,
      "translation": "쉬운 부분인 명령어 디코더부터 시작합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792453Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "We are generating two additional signals `isLoad` and `isStore`.",
      "source_hash": 16381243045144268594,
      "context_hash": 8962713364589476597,
      "translation": "`isLoad`와 `isStore`라는 두 개의 추가 신호를 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:4",
      "source": "There are two more cases in the big `switch` statement:",
      "source_hash": 18168173952673916109,
      "context_hash": 7718887792742303114,
      "translation": "큰 `switch` 문에 두 가지 경우가 더 추가됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Everything is connected as shown in this schematic.",
      "source_hash": 12611957996560956036,
      "context_hash": 41548157080656877,
      "translation": "모든 것은 이 회로도에 나온 대로 연결됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "There is a new _memory access subsystem_.",
      "source_hash": 16089017556516275384,
      "context_hash": 13852072302166687004,
      "translation": "새로운 *메모리 접근 서브시스템*이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "The mux for register write back has a new path (read mem data).",
      "source_hash": 15013241327388567382,
      "context_hash": 10509676956093311010,
      "translation": "레지스터 라이트백용 먹스에는 새로운 경로(read mem data)가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:3",
      "source": "Then we just need to draw two wires, one from the second register output to the written mem data, and another one from the ALU output to the mem address.",
      "source_hash": 8021402077815895244,
      "context_hash": 6924551414000071745,
      "translation": "그런 다음 두 번째 레지스터 출력에서 written mem data로 가는 선 하나와, ALU 출력에서 mem 주소로 가는 선 하나, 이렇게 두 개의 선만 그리면 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:4",
      "source": "Note that we use different wires for reading (read mem data) and for writing (write mem data).",
      "source_hash": 11328521299348653106,
      "context_hash": 6058671954663474566,
      "translation": "읽기(read mem data)와 쓰기(write mem data)에 서로 다른 선을 사용한다는 점에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:5",
      "source": "We use two single-directional data buses instead of a single bidirectional data bus.",
      "source_hash": 6875431806577718190,
      "context_hash": 12994497552928002737,
      "translation": "하나의 양방향 데이터 버스 대신 두 개의 단방향 데이터 버스를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "![](Images/FemtoRV32_design.jpg)",
      "source_hash": 14729754508687835321,
      "context_hash": 7278309113758168734,
      "translation": "![](Images/FemtoRV32_design.jpg)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "One difficulty remains: the same wires are used to read the instructions and to read the data.",
      "source_hash": 3974262990133362490,
      "context_hash": 17154066734928799506,
      "translation": "한 가지 어려움이 남아 있습니다: 명령어를 읽는 데도 데이터를 읽는 데도 같은 선이 사용된다는 점입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "How can be route instructions to the `instr` register and data to register writeback ?",
      "source_hash": 3406626491903720460,
      "context_hash": 12632724905425246495,
      "translation": "명령어는 `instr` 레지스터로, 데이터는 레지스터 라이트백으로 어떻게 라우팅할 수 있을까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:2",
      "source": "To handle that, the finite state machine gets a bit more complicated.",
      "source_hash": 2245498166799674555,
      "context_hash": 7005249231022091830,
      "translation": "이를 처리하기 위해 유한 상태 기계가 조금 더 복잡해집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "TO BE CONTINUED.",
      "source_hash": 17221688342110955557,
      "context_hash": 5650811396554470720,
      "translation": "다음 편에 계속됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:36.792454Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}